				<r3d:description language="eng">The Environmental System Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE) is a data repository for Earth and environmental sciences. ESS-DIVE stores data generated from research funded by or related to the DOE’s Office of Science Biological and Environmental Research program (BER) under its Environmental Systems Science (ESS) activity. This include a variety of observational, experimental, modeling and other data products from a wide range of ecological and urban systems.</r3d:description>
